              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="9">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">c4285486-e502-45fd-8917-4af5dead6850</item>
                    <item name="Locked" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">PLAN 1 / FAST LIVE</item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">PLAN 1 / FAST LIVE
Adjust forward_step, turn_step, rot_step and num_layers.
Fixed brick dimensions; cumulative yaw continues through the crown.
The saved support-corrected shape is the live starting template.
No nonlinear fitting or full gravity checks run while you edit.
check_mode only changes report detail. display_mode 0 hides the mesh preview.
After editing: connect Data 1 to CHECK -&gt; ROBOT, then press CHECK / UPDATE ROBOT.
A failed check leaves the form visible and blocks robot output.</item>
                  </items>
